      "title_zh": "和家人去广州",
      "title_en": "To Guangzhou with the family",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["这", "个", "月", "，", "我", "和", "家人", "去", "广州", "玩", "。", "广州", "的", "天气", "很", "热", "。"],
        ["路上", "，", "我们", "坐", "了", "六", "个", "小时", "的", "车", "。"],
        ["姐姐", "在", "车", "里", "睡觉", "，", "我", "和", "爸爸", "一起", "唱", "歌", "。"],
        ["到", "了", "广州", "，", "我们", "吃", "了", "很", "多", "菜", "。", "那里", "的", "菜", "我", "都", "很", "喜欢", "。"],
        ["我", "觉得", "，", "和", "家人", "一起", "玩", "真", "好", "！", "下", "次", "我们", "还", "要", "去", "！"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "This month I went to Guangzhou with my family. The weather in Guangzhou was hot.",
        "We spent six hours in the car on the way.",
        "My sister slept in the car, and Dad and I sang songs together.",
        "When we got to Guangzhou, we ate lots of dishes. I liked all the food there.",
        "I think going places with your family is great! We want to go again next time!"
      ],
      "names": ["广州"],
