      "title_en": "Sorry!",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["今天", "，", "我", "和", "我", "哥", "去", "看", "一", "个", "日本", "电影", "。"],
        ["电影", "是", "七", "点", "的", "，", "我们", "七", "点", "十", "分", "到", "。", "我们", "马上", "进去", "。"],
        ["我", "走", "错", "了", "，", "坐", "在", "了", "一", "个", "女人", "的", "地方", "。"],
        ["我", "说", "：", "“", "对不起", "！", "”", "她", "笑", "了", "笑", "，", "说", "：", "“", "没什么", "。", "”", "我", "马上", "站", "起来", "，", "找到", "了", "我", "的", "地方", "。"],
        ["电影", "非常", "好", "，", "我们", "都", "很", "喜欢", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Today my brother and I went to see a Japanese film.",
        "The film was at seven, and we arrived at ten past. We went straight in.",
        "I went the wrong way and sat in a woman's seat.",
        "I said: “Sorry!” She smiled and said: “No problem.” I stood up straight away and found my seat.",
        "The film was great — we both loved it."
      ],
